---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — zipgirl">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <div class="eyebrow">the human behind the tabs</div><h1>About <em>me.</em></h1>
    <p style="font:1.35rem var(--serif);color:var(--ink)">Curious by default. Analytical by training. Creative by nature.</p>
    <p>I'm an engineering-minded creator interested in the space where mathematics, technology, systems and human ideas meet. This site is my evolving record of projects, learning and the things that make me think.</p>
    <hr class="rule"/>
    <div class="two-col"><section><div class="eyebrow">01 / professional</div><h2>How I think</h2><p>I enjoy breaking complicated problems into understandable parts, building models, testing assumptions and communicating results clearly. My interests include engineering, operations research, programming, optimization and data analytics.</p></section>
    <section><div class="eyebrow">02 / beyond the work</div><h2>What inspires me</h2><p>Books, cinema, music, visual culture, design, the internet and the small rituals that make a life feel considered. I like spaces where precision and imagination can coexist.</p></section></div>
    <hr class="rule"/>
    <div class="eyebrow">03 / toolkit</div><h2>Skills & interests</h2>
    <div><span class="tag">Operations Research</span><span class="tag">Optimization</span><span class="tag">Engineering</span><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Data Analytics</span><span class="tag">Programming</span><span class="tag">Technical Writing</span><span class="tag">Research</span></div>
    <hr class="rule"/>
    <div class="eyebrow">04 / correspondence</div><h2>Let's make something matter.</h2><p>For project enquiries, thoughtful collaborations or professional opportunities:</p><p><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@zipgirl.dev">hello@zipgirl.dev ↗</a></p>
    <p class="kicker">zipgirl is a public alias. Personal details are shared selectively.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>